Drives the action scripts in lib-d77-welcome (each script performs a single,
self-contained action such as installing a package group). Privileged
commands inside those scripts call `sudo -A`; this program supplies the
password via a SUDO_ASKPASS helper instead of a terminal prompt.
"""

